sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / GitOps
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Controller as modelservice-controller-manager<br/>Watch Stream TLS 1.2+
    participant ChildRes as Child Resources<br/>(Deployments, Services,<br/>InferencePool, HTTPRoutes)
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus
    participant MetricsSvc as Metrics Service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS

    Note over User,ChildRes: Flow 1: ModelService Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply ModelService CR<br/>Auth: User kubeconfig
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: Watch event notification<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: GET BaseConfig ConfigMap<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: BaseConfig data
    Note over Controller: Merge BaseConfig with<br/>ModelService spec overrides<br/>(mergo + text/template)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CreateOrUpdate Prefill Deployment<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CreateOrUpdate Decode Deployment<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CreateOrUpdate EPP Deployment + Service<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CreateOrUpdate InferencePool + InferenceModel<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CreateOrUpdate HTTPRoute<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    Controller->>K8sAPI: CreateOrUpdate ServiceAccounts + RoleBindings<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA token
    K8sAPI-->>ChildRes: Resources provisioned
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Update ModelService status<br/>(PrefillAvailable, DecodeProgressing, etc.)

    Note over Prometheus,MetricsSvc: Flow 2: Metrics Collection

    Prometheus->>MetricsSvc: GET /metrics<br/>HTTPS 8443/TCP TLS
    MetricsSvc->>MetricsSvc: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
    MetricsSvc-->>Prometheus: Prometheus metrics response
